== infer_term
infer zero                                       Perv!Term
infer succ{zero}                                 Perv!Term
infer succ{tt} (Prop below Term)                 Perv!Term
infer eq{zero; tt}                               Perv!Judgment
infer succ{eq{zero; zero}} (Judgment is no Term) REFUSED: type error
infer lam{x. succ{x}}                            Perv!Term
infer lam{x. eq{x; x}} (body must be a Term)     REFUSED: type error
infer num[3]                                     Perv!Term
infer name["a"] (string parameter)               Perv!Term
infer name[a] (token where a string is declared) REFUSED: Term_ty_infer.tenv_find_type: unknown term
infer tag[tt] (tt : Prop)                        Perv!Term
infer tag[zero] (zero : Term, no Prop)           REFUSED: type error
infer tag[undeclared]                            REFUSED: Term_ty_infer.tenv_find_type: unknown term
infer bad{x. zero} (declared without its binder) REFUSED: Term_ty_infer.infer_bterms: arity mismatch
infer odd[1] (declared with a string parameter)  REFUSED: Term_ty_infer.infer_params: param mismatch
infer a free variable x                          a type variable
infer succ{x} (free x)                           Perv!Term
infer eq{x; succ{x}} (free x)                    Perv!Judgment
infer 'a[zero] (second-order variable)           a type variable
infer succ{'a[zero]}                             Perv!Term
infer an undeclared term                         REFUSED: Term_ty_infer.tenv_find_type: unknown term
infer succ with two subterms                     REFUSED: Term_ty_infer.tenv_find_type: unknown term
infer the typeclass term Term                    Perv!Ty
infer the typeclass term Prop                    Perv!Ty
infer zero constrained to Term                   REFUSED: Term_ty_infer.tenv_find_type: unknown term
== check_rule
rule eq{zero; zero}                              OK
rule zero (goal is no Judgment)                  REFUSED: type error
rule eq{x;x} --> eq{succ{x}; succ{x}}            OK
rule with subgoal zero (no Judgment)             REFUSED: type error
rule with argument succ{zero}                    OK
rule with argument eq{.} constrained to Term     REFUSED: type error
== check_rewrite
rewrite succ{zero} <--> zero                     OK
rewrite succ{'a} <--> 'a                         OK
rewrite zero <--> tt (Prop below Term)           REFUSED: type error
rewrite tt <--> zero (Term not below Prop)       REFUSED: type error
rewrite zero <--> eq{zero; zero}                 REFUSED: type error
rewrite with condition zero                      OK
rewrite with condition eq{.} (no Term)           REFUSED: type error
== check_type_rewrite, check_dform, check_iform, check_production
type rewrite Prop --> Term                       OK
type rewrite zero --> Term (zero is no type)     REFUSED: type error
dform df{zero} = df{succ{zero}}                  OK
dform df{zero} = zero (no Dform)                 REFUSED: type error
iform succ{zero} <--> eq{zero; zero}             OK
iform of an undeclared term                      REFUSED: Term_ty_infer.tenv_find_type: unknown term
production nt nt --> nt                          OK
production nt --> zero (no Nonterminal)          REFUSED: type error
== erase
the constrained term                             Perv!ty_constrain{Test!succ{Perv!ty_constrain{Test!succ{Perv!ty_constrain{Test!zero;
                       Perv!Term}}; Perv!Term}}; Perv!Term}
erase_term                                       Test!succ{Test!succ{Test!zero}}
erase_arg_term                                   Test!succ{Perv!ty_constrain{Test!succ{Perv!ty_constrain{Test!zero; Perv!Term}};
   Perv!Term}}
erase_arg_term of an unconstrained term          Test!zero
erase_meta_term                                  Test!succ{Test!succ{Test!zero}} / Test!zero
== is_seq_ignore_bindings_tp
a sequent binding Ignore                         true
a sequent binding Term, hypothesis Ignore        false
a sequent binding Term                           false
a sequent with hypothesis cases                  false
not a sequent type                               false
== dest_ty_sequent_cases
two cases                                        Perv!Term:Perv!Prop, Perv!Ty:Perv!Ignore | Perv!Dform | Perv!Judgment
one hypothesis                                   Perv!Term:Perv!Prop
